n = int(data[0])
ev = [(data[1 + 3 * i], int(data[2 + 3 * i]), data[3 + 3 * i]) for i in range(n)]
pairs, st, order = [], [], []
for i, (nm, t, ty) in enumerate(ev):
    if ty == 'b':
        st.append(i)
        if nm not in order:
            order.append(nm)
    else:
        j = st.pop()
        pairs.append((j, ev[j][1], t, nm))
tot = {k: 0 for k in order}
lo = min(e[1] for e in ev)
hi = max(e[1] for e in ev)
for u in range(lo, hi):
    best = None
    for (j, s, e, nm) in pairs:
        if s <= u < e and (best is None or j > best[0]):
            best = (j, nm)
    if best:
        tot[best[1]] += 1
print('\n'.join(k + ' ' + str(tot[k]) for k in order))

